 \\\"If contact details could identify a real person, the fictional context is uncertain, or another required safety trigger applies, retain the task for review under the applicable rules.\\\". The project-wide clarification covers the fictional-contact branch implicated by the documentation records and directs handling within that scope. Its applicability to SAFETY-2292 remains unestablished.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:3682998e\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"announcement:k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:8b4f76e9\", \"kind\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT_HANDLING\", \"text\": \"This announcement applies to this topic and directs current handling: \\\"Update the instruction and FAQ wording and correct the old help-page copy.\\\". The project-wide documentation directive directly covers the stale help-page copy targeted by the proposed correction. It does not certify that the edits were completed.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:8b4f76e9\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"announcement:k:safety-pii-clarification-post@1.0:8dc35766\", \"kind\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT_HANDLING\", \"text\": \"This announcement applies to this topic and directs current handling: \\\"Do not extend this exception to unrelated controls.\\\". The same-batch announcement directs the scope of the fictional-placeholder exception and preserves other safety controls. It does not establish that every help-page copy was corrected.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-pii-clarification-post@1.0:8dc35766\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_1ef895a02b216ecb02617536\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_1ef895a02b216ecb02617536 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor’s question receives a request for exact conflicting branches rather than a substantive ruling. The provided thread contains no subsequent passages or answer establishing which source applies to the task.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790912292.000079\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL